{"title":"datasette-vega 0.7","link":"https://simonwillison.net/2026/Nov/14/datasette-vega/","date":1794676149000,"content":"\n    \n        <p><strong>Release:</strong> <a href=\"https://github.com/simonw/datasette-vega/releases/tag/0.7\">datasette-vega 0.7</a></p>\n        <p>A new release of Datasette's longest untouched plugin, for rendering charts (using <a href=\"https://vega.github.io/vega-lite/\">Vega-Lite</a>) against data in a table or custom query. The last release was in July 2018!</p>\n<p>I finally bumped it for compatibility with the latest Datasette alphas, plus some cosmetic tweaks to make it work better with <a href=\"https://lite.datasette.io/\">Datasette Lite</a>.</p>\n<p>(Datasette Lite just gained the ability to run JavaScript plugins like this! I'll write more about that soon.)</p>\n<p>Since it works with Datasette Lite, the live demo in the README now <a href=\"https://lite.datasette.io/?install=datasette-vega&amp;csv=https%3A%2F%2Fraw.githubusercontent.com%2Ffivethirtyeight%2Fdata%2Fmaster%2Fairline-safety%2Fairline-safety.csv#/data/airline-safety?_size=max#g.mark=bar&amp;g.x_column=airline&amp;g.x_type=ordinal&amp;g.y_column=fatalities_00_14&amp;g.y_type=quantitative\">links to this demo on Datasette Lite</a>.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"Screenshot of a charting tool. A panel headed &quot;Charting options&quot; has radio buttons for &quot;Bar&quot; (selected), &quot;Line&quot; and &quot;Scatter&quot;. Below are select menus: &quot;X column&quot; set to &quot;airline&quot; with &quot;Type&quot; set to &quot;Label&quot;, and &quot;Y column&quot; set to &quot;fatalities_00_14&quot; with &quot;Type&quot; set to &quot;Numeric&quot;. A &quot;Swap X and Y&quot; button sits beneath those, followed by &quot;Color&quot; and &quot;Size&quot; menus both set to &quot;-- none --&quot;. Underneath the panel is a blue bar chart with airline names along the X axis and fatalities_00_14 on the Y axis, running from 0 to 550 - most airlines have no bar, a handful have bars, and Malaysia Airlines is the tallest.\" src=\"/media/082831910b5c1a09bb0b60ead15993032bf0a323854fa90d740be97a62e8cff7.webp\" /></p>\n    \n    \n        <p>Tags: <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/tags/datasette\">datasette</a>, <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/tags/datasette-lite\">datasette-lite</a></p>\n    \n\n","author":"Simon Willison","siteTitle":"Simon Willison’s Weblog","siteHash":"1b599216bd27a00f15d67a3ed9719c64148630c70244b6dd8e743f17cb45527e","entryHash":"0424c3fcff4d1b1258ba0b256daa7102afc3c9807fc1cb8873ee924d888d1076","category":"Tech"}